      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1792439358938,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• Tool definition: risk tier, execution\nsite, capabilities\n\n• Run context: live or unattended, taint\nflag, approvals already given\n\n• Model trust tier (A / B / C)\n\n• Rule set loaded from versioned policy\nfiles\n\n• Every decision is emitted as a telemetry\nevent with its reason",
      "originalText": "• Tool definition: risk tier, execution\nsite, capabilities\n\n• Run context: live or unattended, taint\nflag, approvals already given\n\n• Model trust tier (A / B / C)\n\n• Rule set loaded from versioned policy\nfiles\n\n• Every decision is emitted as a telemetry\nevent with its reason",
      "fontSize": 16,
